<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PCO3 · Simulador de Día Completo</title>
<style>
:root {
  --primary: #1e3a5f;
  --success: #10b981;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --danger: #ef4444;
  --purple: #7c3aed;
  --bg: #f0f4f8;
  --card: #fff;
  --border: #e2e8f0;
  --text: #1a202c;
  --muted: #64748b;
  --radius: 12px;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }

/* HEADER */
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2040, #1e3a5f);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
}
.header h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
.header p { font-size: 13px; opacity: .75; margin-top: 4px; }

.container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; }

/* CARDS */
.card { background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
.card-header { padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fafcff; }
.card-header h2 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }
.card-body { padding: 18px; }

/* STATUS STRIP */
.status-strip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 12px 18px;
  background: #f0fdf4; border-bottom: 1px solid #86efac;
  font-size: 13px; color: #065f46; font-weight: 600;
  display: none;
}
.status-strip.show { display: flex; }
.status-strip.error { background: #fef2f2; border-color: #fca5a5; color: #991b1b; }

/* GRID */
.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
.grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 10px; }
@media(max-width:600px) { .grid-2, .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ROLE CARDS */
.role-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 14px;
  background: var(--card);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all .2s;
  position: relative;
}
.role-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30,58,95,.1); }
.role-card .role-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.role-card .role-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--primary); }
.role-card .role-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4; }
.role-card .role-url { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; word-break: break-all; background: var(--bg); padding: 4px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }
.role-card input.url-input {
  width: 100%; font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 6px; margin-top: 6px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text); font-family: monospace;
}
.role-card input.url-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); }
.open-btn {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;
  background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border: none;
  border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer; width: 100%; font-family: inherit;
  transition: background .2s;
}
.open-btn:hover { background: #2d5a8e; }
.open-btn:disabled { background: var(--border); color: var(--muted); cursor: not-allowed; }

/* SEED BUTTONS */
.seed-section { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.btn-seed {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 13px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 10px;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s; width: 100%;
  justify-content: center;
}
.btn-seed-primary { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
.btn-seed-primary:hover { background: #2d5a8e; }
.btn-seed-primary:disabled { background: var(--border); color: var(--muted); cursor: not-allowed; }
.btn-seed-danger { background: #fef2f2; color: var(--danger); border: 1px solid #fca5a5; }
.btn-seed-danger:hover { background: #fee2e2; }

/* SCENARIO STEPS */
.scenario-step {
  display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.scenario-step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.step-num {
  width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--primary); color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.step-role { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.step-action { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2px; }
.step-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top:2px; line-height: 1.5; }
.step-icon { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

/* PROGRESS */
.progress-wrap { margin: 16px 0 0; }
.progress-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
.progress-bar { height: 8px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
.progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--success); border-radius: 8px; transition: width .5s ease; width: 0%; }

/* STATS ROW */
.stats-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.stat-pill {
  background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 12px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
}
.stat-pill.ok { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; border-color: #86efac; }
.stat-pill.pending { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; border-color: #fde68a; }

/* LOG */
.log-box {
  background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8;
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px;
  font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px;
  max-height: 180px; overflow-y: auto;
  line-height: 1.7;
  display: none;
}
.log-box.show { display: block; }
.log-line.ok { color: #10b981; }
.log-line.err { color: #ef4444; }
.log-line.info { color: #60a5fa; }

/* DIVIDER */
.divider { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 4px 0 16px; }
.section-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>🏗️ PCO3 — Simulador de Día Completo</h1>
  <p>Genera datos realistas en Firebase y lanza todos los módulos sincronizados</p>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- URLS DE LOS MÓDULOS -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <span style="font-size:18px">🔗</span>
      <h2>Paso 1 — URLs de los módulos en GHL</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px">Pega aquí las URLs públicas de cada módulo en Innova Sync. Quedan guardadas en el navegador.</p>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="role-card">
          <div class="role-icon">🏊</div>
          <div class="role-name">Piscinero</div>
          <input class="url-input" id="url-piscinero" placeholder="https://..." oninput="guardarUrl('piscinero',this.value)">
          <button class="open-btn" onclick="abrirModulo('piscinero','Piscinero Test','piscinero_sim')">Abrir</button>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <div class="role-icon">🏊</div>
